        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI lead qualification assistant.\n\nAnalyze the lead information below and return a qualification result.\n\nLead:\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nCompany Size: {{ $json.company_size }}\nBudget: {{ $json.budget }}\nService: {{ $json.service }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.timeline }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}\n\nEvaluate the lead based on:\n- Budget\n- Company size\n- Service fit\n- Timeline/urgency\n- Intent expressed in the message\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"qualification\": \"HOT, WARM, or COLD\",\n  \"score\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"Brief explanation\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Recommended next action\"\n}\n\nScore the lead from 0 to 100."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
